														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-3675624">
									

<p>It's missing something. The narrative's nice and doesn't make the mistakes that many make like not mentioning the effects of later revelations earlier on and thus not breaking suspension of disbelief. But there's not much beyond that, stuff I'd like to see are things like more info on -A, how it's implanted &quot;in the wild&quot;, how it was developed, if it's been reverse engineered to a degree and the effects of that and if it hasn't why, more information about the psychology and mind of 3483 as even if it's move to a more complex mind was inspired by a human mind it seems unlikely that it was or would be as human as it seems, for exsample as it is it seems like a noncentralised intelegence, what are the consequences of that? More detail for the old containment protocols, for exsample plans for if 3483 became actively hostile or how to prevent interference in anything critical, what has been learned from the code, what precidents have been set by the whole situation etc.</p>

